Tasks without an id, or with a null id, get no row so Claude Code uses its default
-- input.json --
{"tasks":[{"name":"anonymous","description":"no id so default rendering"},{"id":"kept","name":"kept","description":"has id"},{"id":null,"name":"nullid"}]}
-- output --
"kept"	\e[1mkept\e[0m \e[2m·\e[0m \e[2mhas id\e[0m
